<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela Mantex 9-month net up 350 pct.</title>
<headline>Venezuela Mantex 9-month net up 350 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net profit 6.30 billion bolivars vs 1.42 billion</p>
<p>Exchange gains 3.30 billion bolivars vs 581 million</p>
<p>Monetary gains 4.92 billion bolivars vs 192 million</p>
<p>Cost of sales 18.1 billion bolivars vs 19.4 billion</p>
<p>Net sales 21.37 billion bolivars vs 21.29 billion</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in inflation-adjusted September 30, 1996 bolivars.</p>
<p>Accounts are consolidated.</p>
<p>Mantex SACA is a Venezuelan textile manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
</text>
